  "details": "Ever since the past few updates, me and quite a few other users it seems, have been getting entire desktop freezes while in VRC. No mouse or keyboard input, looping audio in VRC only, complete inability to use my PC for minutes at a time until I either unplug my PC and force power it off, or just ride out the lag spike until another one inevitably happens.\n\nI've never had this many hard lag spikes and full on VR crashes in the past 5 years I've played VRC vs the past few weeks.\n\nI don't know what the new update changed, but it needs to be fixed, and fast.\n\nCurrent PC Build:\n\n5700X3D\n\n3060ti\n\n64gbs DDR4 \n\nRunning everything on an SSD",
